  "sourceTitle": "Tiger Salsa",
  "sourceText": "Tiger Salsa\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Sunday, February 14, 2010 - 2:53am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n4 mediums tomatoes diced\n1 jalapeno seeded & diced fine\ncup onion diced\ncup olive oil\n2 tablespoons lime juice\n1 tablespoon dried thyme\n2 tablespoons dried cilantro\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix all together well and refrigerate for at least 1 day. This salsa keeps well for up to a week in the refrigerator. 2 Makes 2 cups.",
